<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - August 1.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - August 1.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share  Bombay  Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement at the closing-session  of friday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day  and their percentage contribution to the net change. The tentative  index at the close was 4351.83, 46.07 points or 1.07 percent higher  than thursday's close.</p>
